<title>UK: Dresdner sets call warrants on the SMI.</title>
<headline>Dresdner sets call warrants on the SMI.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dresdner Bank AG has issued 500,000 European-style call warrants on the Swiss Market Index, lead manager Banque Internationale de Placement said.</p>
<p>One index is controlled by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    5,200 CHF		 PREMIUM	11.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.70 CHF		  GEARING	28.3 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   31.MAR.98		 PAYDATE	15.MAY.97</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  4,805 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
